{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-html-001","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-001"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-001/answers/answer-html-001","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T01:00:00Z","source_created_at":"2024-03-01T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-06-01T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"本科毕业后应该先工作还是读研？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我家里暂时不能支持我继续读书，毕业时拿到了一份稳定的工作。我先工作两年，建立储蓄并确认自己想研究的方向，之后利用周末准备考试，最终读了在职研究生。","raw_html":"<div class=\"RichContent-inner\"><p>我家里暂时不能支持我继续读书，毕业时拿到了一份稳定的工作。我先工作两年，建立储蓄并确认自己想研究的方向，之后利用周末准备考试，最终读了在职研究生。</p></div>","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-education","name":"教育选择"},{"external_id":"topic-career","name":"职业规划"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T01:00:00Z","voteup_count":42,"comment_count":8,"thanks_count":3},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-001"},"raw":{"sha256":"8a4d7c8c44dbf119e8dd8c0b5e5a2f0e1c1b9d70cb0b5e6b2a7a1f4f9f9a1a01","payload":{"external_id":"answer-html-001"}}}
{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-html-002","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-001"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-001/answers/answer-html-002","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T01:01:00Z","source_created_at":"2024-04-12T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-07-18T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"本科毕业后应该先工作还是读研？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我毕业时已经确定想做科研，也拿到了奖学金和导师的明确课题，因此选择直接读研。学校资源和同伴环境让我更快确认了研究方向。","raw_html":"<div class=\"RichContent-inner\"><p>我毕业时已经确定想做科研，也拿到了奖学金和导师的明确课题，因此选择直接读研。学校资源和同伴环境让我更快确认了研究方向。</p></div>","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-education","name":"教育选择"},{"external_id":"topic-research","name":"科研道路"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T01:01:00Z","voteup_count":67,"comment_count":11,"thanks_count":5},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-002"},"raw":{"sha256":"1f4b7834dc4891efb0a8b173ad3bc7b8f4fd3d4d55f930b78c9f0f7653b5c5d2","payload":{"external_id":"answer-html-002"}}}
{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-html-003","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-002"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-002/answers/answer-html-003","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T01:02:00Z","source_created_at":"2023-08-20T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-02-20T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"要不要从大厂转去创业团队？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我在大公司工作了五年，手里有十八个月的储蓄，也想承担更大的业务责任，所以接受了创业团队的邀请。后来公司融资失败，我又凭借这段经历找到了新的工作。","raw_html":"<div class=\"RichContent-inner\"><p>我在大公司工作了五年，手里有十八个月的储蓄，也想承担更大的业务责任，所以接受了创业团队的邀请。后来公司融资失败，我又凭借这段经历找到了新的工作。</p></div>","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-career","name":"职业选择"},{"external_id":"topic-startup","name":"创业"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T01:02:00Z","voteup_count":31,"comment_count":6,"thanks_count":2},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-003"},"raw":{"sha256":"2c8cb2cc4d7cb14fdd2d3b3d8d3ce1e8ddff12f0b9e4d8d7b3c0e0b6f7c8d9e0","payload":{"external_id":"answer-html-003"}}}
{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-html-004","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-002"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-002/answers/answer-html-004","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T01:03:00Z","source_created_at":"2023-09-03T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-01-15T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"要不要从大厂转去创业团队？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我也认真考虑过创业，但当时家里有房贷，储蓄只能覆盖四个月生活费，伴侣也不希望承担突然失业的风险。于是我留在大公司，同时用下班时间做小项目。","raw_html":"<div class=\"RichContent-inner\"><p>我也认真考虑过创业，但当时家里有房贷，储蓄只能覆盖四个月生活费，伴侣也不希望承担突然失业的风险。于是我留在大公司，同时用下班时间做小项目。</p></div>","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-career","name":"职业选择"},{"external_id":"topic-risk","name":"风险管理"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T01:03:00Z","voteup_count":54,"comment_count":9,"thanks_count":4},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-004"},"raw":{"sha256":"3d9e8f4c1b6a2e7d0c5f8a9b3e2d1c0f9a8b7c6d5e4f3a2b1c0d9e8f7a6b5c4d","payload":{"external_id":"answer-html-004"}}}
{"schema_version":"source_record.v1","source":{"code":"demo","adapter_code":"manual_upload","adapter_version":"1.0.0","authorization_ref":null},"external_ref":{"type":"answer","id":"answer-html-005","parent":{"type":"question","id":"question-demo-003"}},"canonical_url":"https://example.test/demo/questions/question-demo-003/answers/answer-html-005","fetched_at":"2026-08-21T01:04:00Z","source_created_at":"2024-01-08T00:00:00Z","source_updated_at":"2024-05-08T00:00:00Z","availability":"AVAILABLE","content":{"title":"转行数据分析是否应该报班？","body_format":"TEXT","body":"我没有报班，先用公开课程补统计基础，再做了三个能展示业务理解的项目，每周找从业者改简历。六个月后我拿到第一份数据分析工作。","raw_html":"<div class=\"RichContent-inner\"><p>我没有报班，先用公开课程补统计基础，再做了三个能展示业务理解的项目，每周找从业者改简历。六个月后我拿到第一份数据分析工作。</p></div>","language":"zh-CN"},"topics":[{"external_id":"topic-career-change","name":"转行"},{"external_id":"topic-learning","name":"学习方式"}],"engagement":{"observed_at":"2026-08-21T01:04:00Z","voteup_count":38,"comment_count":7,"thanks_count":3},"restricted_author":{"external_id":"demo-author-005"},"raw":{"sha256":"4e1a7b9c2d3f5a6b8c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2b","payload":{"external_id":"answer-html-005"}}}
